# ── Database (async) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The [asyncio] extra is explicit on purpose. SQLAlchemy 2.1 moved `greenlet` out of
# the default install and into this extra; without it the async engine every MCP uses
# raises ImportError. 2.0.x pulls greenlet transitively, so this is a no-op today and
# a prevented outage the first time the lock resolves to 2.1.
